"24091ebd-f7a2-4e14-ac09-456e0eb0d8ce","position":{"commit_sha":"d3fedcafb27c540b0d58406437426b105fe1bf44","position":"1786508685249275001-24091ebd-f7a2-4e14-ac09-456e0eb0d8ce"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7616cbde764e2f51747a8c643c00699915abc57d6c17c0612dd0e4eb74171a95","event_uuid":"f1c6ea6b-b95c-49d0-9446-43d5ca33e7b3","position":{"commit_sha":"47e82395984578c77e274594ad7eabcbbf1840ec","position":"1786508710065716001-f1c6ea6b-b95c-49d0-9446-43d5ca33e7b3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"01fd5823a72882e98ed2878438b276ac8c77c5e82db20959a2b34d1f0ad82261","event_uuid":"484ee95b-1f96-4156-a040-a5c986eabb38","position":{"commit_sha":"8eca75be647c0223b570b4b93ac6f1e69936399b","position":"1786509005868852001-484ee95b-1f96-4156-a040-a5c986eabb38"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"8cb3c97ef795d1270d383faf0192ac45fb87519b9c3cc6c8b19cacad02ccc793","event_uuid":"70c83126-ab09-45d4-9cbf-8baf0e665b5c","position":{"commit_sha":"c2ffe355b7f82f18514599cd6305a961a717a6d4","position":"1786509433183388766-70c83126-ab09-45d4-9cbf-8baf0e665b5c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"956fdafbc7450686b5ba9a64e30bae0bb854a2876ec000782eb3ad87c5d6ffe7","event_uuid":"0eda7686-e816-417d-8914-73f88d895569","position":{"commit_sha":"5b04a5df5422acd22c3baf0140a4741570958878","position":"1786510869528269001-0eda7686-e816-417d-8914-73f88d895569"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan review passed and the ticket is claimed. Reproduced the absent-script failure in a workflow-body regression test, then added an early selector guard that emits an empty matrix and has-shards=false only when scripts/mutation_gate.py is absent. Present-tree execution and nonzero propagation remain covered. Local evidence: 84 workflow/tree-skew tests pass; make lint and make typecheck pass. Full suite and main-health CI are still running with no failures observed.","timestamp":1786509005868852001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Main-health run 31562871624 completed green on ac0f62be11: all 17 executed jobs passed, including all seven mutation shards and every platform suite. Gerrit 1627 carries the pre-gate compatibility fix and has LLM-Review +1; Verified is still running.","timestamp":1786510869528269001}],"created_at":1786507808605523001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f3c18903-20fe-40e6-8290-4e5d67f38f07","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b273-e0ba-f719-4f1c"},{"link_uuid":"70c83126-ab09-45d4-9cbf-8baf0e665b5c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"f7a9-596a-d1c2-42a9"}],"description":"# Mutation gate has no \"change predates the gate\" guard, so it hard-fails older changes\n\nThe bounded mutation gate runs its reusable workflow from `refs/heads/main` but executes\nit against the CHECKED-OUT PATCHSET tree. When a change is based on a commit older than\nthe one that introduced `scripts/mutation_gate.py`, the script is absent from that tree and\nthe step dies:\n\n    /home/runner/work/rebar/rebar/.venv/bin/python3: can't open file\n    '/home/runner/work/rebar/rebar/scripts/mutation_gate.py': [Errno 2] No such file or directory\n    ##[error]Process completed with exit code 2.\n\nThe result is a `Verified -1` that says nothing about the change's own quality.\n\n## Evidence\n\nTwo consecutive runs, both failing pre-analysis, on changes based on `c0bb6dcc` (which\npredates the walking-skeleton commit `57d19254` that added the script):\n\n- change 1621 patchset 1 — run 31561319537, job 94004044... exit code 2\n- change 1624 patchset 1 — run 31561579063, job 94005317237, exit code 2\n\nOn 1624 the checkout step itself SUCCEEDED (\"Checkout the Gerrit patchset ✓\"); the failure\nis in \"Run changed mutation shards\", so this is not a fetch race. It is deterministic for\nany change whose base predates the script.\n\n## Why this is the gate's bug, not the author's\n\nEvery sibling gate in the same workflow already guards for exactly this, and skips with an\nexplanatory message rather than failing. For example the env-var registry gate:\n\n    if [ ! -f scripts/gen_env_registry.py ]; then\n      echo \"scripts/gen_env_registry.py not in checked-out tree (change predates the gate) \\\n    — skipping; the gate re-enforces on rebase and on every post-merge change\"\n      exit 0\n    fi\n\n`scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py` carries the same guard. The mutation gate is the only\none missing it.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] The mutation gate skips cleanly (exit 0, explanatory message) when\n      `scripts/mutation_gate.py` is absent from the checked-out tree, matching the wording\n      and behaviour of the sibling gates.\n- [ ] A change based before the walking-skeleton commit gets no `Verified -1` from this\n      gate.\n- [ ] A change based at or after it still runs the gate for real — the skip must not\n      become a silent bypass on current changes.\n\n## Workaround\n\nRebase the change onto current `origin/main`; the script then exists and the gate runs\n(and correctly reports \"no protected shard selected\" for changes touching no shard).\n\n## Provenance\n\nHit twice while landing the build-drift warning (`tasty-unappeased-leopard`,\nb273-e0ba-f719-4f1c). Filed at operator direction so the mutation-testing work has the\nsignal.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/_mutation.yml","reason":"Add the pre-gate compatibility check before invoking the patchset-local mutation script."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py","reason":"Lock the absent-script skip and current-tree real-execution workflow contracts."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","f7a9-596a-d1c2-42a9"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"9dee1d8e-24ce-494b-8da8-e5e3fb2b6ec2","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"aff7-9e1f-ba3b-4a54","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Mutation gate hard-fails changes that predate its own script","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5cdd3fbc-0349-4968-bb5b-53f3ae17ef03","f3c18903-20fe-40e6-8290-4e5d67f38f07","077d6bf4-b7e2-4274-b42f-8288d848bdce","9dee1d8e-24ce-494b-8da8-e5e3fb2b6ec2","24091ebd-f7a2-4e14-ac09-456e0eb0d8ce","f1c6ea6b-b95c-49d0-9446-43d5ca33e7b3","484ee95b-1f96-4156-a040-a5c986eabb38","70c83126-ab09-45d4-9cbf-8baf0e665b5c","0eda7686-e816-417d-8914-73f88d895569"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786510869528269002,"uuid":"150e4d99-34ae-44e9-9c0c-d694f1450fd1"}